ink\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9f30bc0c9c793d3\" href=\"?note=d9f30bc0c9c793d3\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-k4\">89-df-modal-logic-k4</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{A}_{T}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal{A}_{T}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9e7a8687a65c356f\" href=\"?note=9e7a8687a65c356f\" title=\"89-df-t-axiom\">89-df-t-axiom</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}logic\\text{-}s4}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{S4}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{K4}\\cup\\mathcal{A}_{T}\\subseteq X,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;(A\\in X\\to\\Box A\\in X)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}logic\\text{-}s4}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{S4}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{K4}\\cup\\mathcal{A}_{T}\\subseteq X,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;(A\\in X\\to\\Box A\\in X)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-logic-k4","status":"resolved","id":"d9f30bc0c9c793d3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-logic-k4]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-2","targ